  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Accessible and Inclusive Education in  Response to Earthquakes Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fostering Accessible and Inclusive Education in Response to Earthquakes Project (FAIREDU) is built on the framework and the results of the Croatia Rebuilds Inclusive Schools Project with financial support of the Government of Croatia. The project aims to ensure sustainability by supporting transformation of schools into accessible and disability-friendly education facilities, extend the provision of customized support for students with disabilities, and provide guidance to key local entities</narrative>
  </description>
